- Category: Filters, Adjustments. (11 October 2026)
- Purpose: separates a height map's frequencies into two maps, one with large-scale differences and one with small-scale differences. (11 October 2026)
- Main parameters: "Relief" (0.0 to 32.0, sets the detail size of the Displacement output; default not stated). (11 October 2026)
